JnuInv←{
   ⍝ Inverse of Jnu: Julian day number ⍵ → M D Y
   ⍝ Standard Meeus inverse algorithm
    l←⌊⍵+68569.5
    n←⌊4×l÷146097
    l←l-⌊((146097×n)+3)÷4
    i←⌊4000×(l+1)÷1461001
    l←31+l-⌊1461×i÷4
    j←⌊80×l÷2447
    d←l-⌊2447×j÷80
    l←⌊j÷11
    m←j+2-12×l
    y←(100×n-49)+i+l
    z←m d y
    ⍝ Verify round-trip; adjust day if needed
    ⍵=Jnu z: z
    m(d+⌊0.5+⍵-Jnu z)y }
